{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28541","headline":"送牛相出镇襄州 · 杜牧","name":"送牛相出镇襄州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"盛时常注意，南雍暂分茅。\n紫殿辞明主，岩廊别旧交。\n危幢侵碧雾，寒斾猎红旓。\n德业悬秦镜，威声隐楚郊。\n拜尘先洒泪，成厦昔容巢。\n遥仰沈碑会，鸳鸯玉佩敲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28541.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28541","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}